            "description_html": "<b>Heavy Duty Door Saver Hold Open Arm - Cush-N-Stop Arm</b>\r\n<p>\r\nT-Bar style Cush-N-Stop Hold Open arm for 4040 Series Style Closers. Fits <a href=\"/products/lcn-4040-series-replacement-ada-compliant-heavy-duty-door-closer-global-tc4300\"><b>Global TC4300 Door Closers</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/extra-heavy-duty-door-closer-deltana-dc40\"><b>Deltana DC40 Door Closers</b></a>. Can be used with any closer that has a  15mm Hexagon shaft (15 mm x 6 Sided).\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Parallel Arm Mount Only</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Heavy duty rigid arm assembly and soffit plate with field reversible dead stop. \"T\" bar turn knob to activated or inactivate the hold open function. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n Available in 2 finishes of Aluminum or Dark Bronze .\r\n</p>",
